{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0141Dk7u7AtRKZqR8S1jrs3Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XhHENGYXj4UW1xu3YwzppQ","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Validate simulation systems","subagent_type":"Explore","prompt":"In /root/tank-simulation, verify these simulation systems are implemented. Search for the actual code implementing each:\n\n1. Temperature model - UA-based heat transfer, heater logic with deadband, never cools\n2. Nitrogen cycle - detritus -> mineralization -> TAN -> nitrite -> nitrate, Monod-style rates, 4.57 mg O2/mg N\n3. Ammonia speciation - pKa formula, fraction_nh3 calculation\n4. Dissolved oxygen - DO saturation table (0C->14.6, 10C->11.3, 20C->9.1, 30C->7.6), reaeration, photosynthesis/respiration\n5. pH and alkalinity - nitrification consumes alkalinity (0.1428 meq/mg N), pH from alkalinity and DIC\n6. Substrate - 1-3 layers, inert sand/gravel, active planted, coarse porous, nutrient stores\n7. Plants - FastStem and RootFeedingRosette guilds, light/temp/nutrient-limited growth\n8. Algae/periphyton - suspended algae + periphyton pools\n9. Microbes/microfauna - decomposer biomass, nitrifier guilds (AOB, NOB, comammox), microfauna grazing\n10. Shrimp - adults/juveniles/berried, condition/molt_stress/reproductive_readiness, temperature-dependent reproduction\n\nSearch for key formulas and constants. Report any missing systems."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14831,"cache_read_input_tokens":8780,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14831},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94a28873-9e1b-4b56-baad-3f78c1e4f81f","uuid":"e92f62ae-4349-43b5-828c-d18b39d084ef"}
