ield}` must be in the range 0.0..=24.0, got {value}\")]\n    57→    HoursOutOfRange { field: &'static str, value: f64 },\n    58→    #[error(\"field `{field}` must be above 0.0 C, got {value}\")]\n    59→    TemperatureTooLow { field: &'static str, value: f64 },\n    60→    #[error(\"source profile id must not be empty\")]\n    61→    EmptySourceProfileId,\n    62→    #[error(\"invariant violation for `{field}` with value {value}\")]\n    63→    InvariantViolation { field: &'static str, value: f64 },\n    64→    #[error(\"unknown source water profile: `{id}`\")]\n    65→    UnknownSourceProfile { id: String },\n    66→    #[error(\"invalid source water profile `{id}`: field `{field}` has invalid value {value}\")]\n    67→    InvalidSourceProfile {\n    68→        id: String,\n    69→        field: &'static str,\n    70→        value: f64,\n    71→    },\n    72→    #[error(\"schema version mismatch: expected {expected}, got {actual}\")]\n    73→    SchemaVersionMismatch { expected: u32, actual: u32 },\n    74→    #[error(\"serialization error: {0}\")]\n    75→    Serialization(String),\n    76→    #[error(\"deserialization error: {0}\")]\n    77→    Deserialization(String),\n    78→    #[error(\"cannot remove {requested} shrimp, only {available} available\")]\n    79→    ShrimpRemovalExceedsAvailable { requested: u32, available: u32 },\n    80→}\n    81→\n    82→impl PlayerAction {\n    83→    pub fn validate(&self) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n    84→        match self {\n    85→            Self::Feed { grams } => validate_non_negative(\"grams\", *grams),\n    86→            Self::WaterChangePercent {\n    87→                percent,\n    88→                source_profile_id,\n    89→            } => {\n    90→                validate_percent(\"percent\", *percent)?;\n    91→                if source_profile_id.trim().is_empty() {\n    92→                    Err(SimError::EmptySourceProfileId)\n    93→                } else {\n    94→                    Ok(())\n    95→                }\n    96→            }\n    97→            Self::TrimPlants { fraction }\n    98→            | Self::SiphonDetritus { fraction }\n    99→            | Self::CleanFilter {\n   100→                intensity: fraction,\n   101→            } => validate_fraction(field_name(self), *fraction),\n   102→            Self::AddShrimp { .. } | Self::RemoveShrimp { .. } => Ok(()),\n   103→            Self::ChangePhotoperiod { hours } => {\n   104→                validate_finite(\"hours\", *hours)?;\n   105→                if (0.0..=24.0).contains(hours) {\n   106→                    Ok(())\n   107→                } else {\n   108→                    Err(SimError::HoursOutOfRange {\n   109→                        field: \"hours\",\n   110→                        value: *hours,\n   111→                    })\n   112→                }\n   113→            }\n   114→            Self::ChangeLightIntensity { intensity_index } => {\n   115→                validate_fraction(\"intensity_index\", *intensity_index)\n   116→            }\n   117→            Self::ChangeHeaterSetpoint { setpoint_c } => {\n   118→                validate_temperature(\"setpoint_c\", *setpoint_c)\n   119→            }\n   120→            Self::ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c } => {\n   121→                validate_temperature(\"target_c\", *target_c)\n   122→            }\n   123→            Self::ChangeAeration { intensity, .. } => validate_fraction(\"intensity\", *intensity),\n   124→        }\n   125→    }\n   126→}\n   127→\n   128→fn field_name(action: &PlayerAction) -> &'static str {\n   129→    match action {\n   130→        PlayerAction::TrimPlants { .. } => \"fraction\",\n   131→        PlayerAction::SiphonDetritus { .. } => \"fraction\",\n   132→        PlayerAction::CleanFilter { .. } => \"intensity\",\n   133→        _ => \"value\",\n   134→    }\n   135→}\n   136→\n   137→fn validate_non_negative(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n   138→    validate_finite(field, value)?;\n   139→    if value < 0.0 {\n   140→        Err(SimError::NegativeValue { field, value })\n   141→    } else {\n   142→        Ok(())\n   143→    }\n   144→}\n   145→\n   146→fn validate_fraction(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n   147→    validate_finite(field, value)?;\n   148→    if (0.0..=1.0).contains(&value) {\n   149→        Ok(())\n   150→    } else {\n   151→        Err(SimError::FractionOutOfRange { field, value })\n   152→    }\n   153→}\n   154→\n   155→fn validate_percent(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n   156→    validate_finite(field, value)?;\n   157→    if (0.0..=100.0).contains(&value) {\n   158→        Ok(())\n   159→    } else {\n   160→        Err(SimError::PercentOutOfRange { field, value })\n   161→    }\n   162→}\n   163→\n   164→fn validate_temperature(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n   165→    validate_finite(field, value)?;\n   166→    if value > 0.0 {\n   167→        Ok(())\n   168→    } else {\n   169→        Err(SimError::TemperatureTooLow { field, value })\n   170→    }\n   171→}\n   172→\n   173→fn validate_finite(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n   174→    if value.is_finite() {\n   175→        Ok(())\n   176→    } else {\n   177→        Err(SimError::NonFiniteValue { field, value })\n   178→    }\n   179→}\n   180→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WdDMCtt9dEZwZBs2Y71Xy8","session_id":"94a28873-9e1b-4b56-baad-3f78c1e4f81f","uuid":"3613351e-982d-4301-8ab3-27cf84b1e8cd"}
